  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1602.01 Intrastate Movement of Certain Poultry for Exhibition or Transfer Prohibited.\n\n(a) Poultry intended for exhibition or sale may be moved intrastate except birds or eggs:\n\n(1) From flocks or hatcheries that have not been tested Pullorum and avian influenza free; or\n\n(2) That have any contagious or infectious disease in the flock.\n\nSource. #2171, eff 11-15-82; ss by #2857, eff 9-24-84, EXPIRED 9-24-90\n\nNew. #5120, eff 4-25-91; ss by #6497, eff 4-23-97, EXPIRED: 4-23-05\n\nNew. #8356, eff 5-24-05; ss by #12000, eff 10-15-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr1600.html"
